{"server":"tw","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_st02","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_st02","title":"一波未平","storyCode":"CW-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"74d33fb83d2bd511d3cff5e3c659fcbe8f29c710c3d2e6a240be7296583c2d8d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塞雷婭遭到狙擊，博士遭遇威脅。軍方與副總統達成初步和解。驚魂未定之際，最出乎意料的人出現了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默！太好了，進城之後我就一直在想，什麼時候才能見到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......赫、赫默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊芙利特，過來一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，赫默，我這好好的，能再撂倒一排壞傢伙，還能單手抱著你跑幾圈！你不信的話，我另一隻手抱塞雷婭！哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別說話，會影響醫療無人機的讀數。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......好吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂著頭為她檢查身體的赫默看上去就和往常一樣，細緻又溫柔，但伊芙利特還是覺得很緊張。\n她從不害怕赫默對自己發怒。\n她在成長中學到的第一件事就是，赫默對她發怒就意味著，赫默在關心她。\n她知道，赫默在生氣之後，會幫她擺平那些傷害她的東西，會幫她趕走那些讓她害怕的東西。\n那不是真的憤怒。\n但伊芙利特很害怕沉默的赫默。\n當赫默沒有表現出憤怒，而是比任何時候都要平靜的時候，她會意識到——\n一定有什麼事觸碰到了赫默的底線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來特里蒙的天總是灰濛濛的，烏雲大得像怪獸，難怪你以前走進房間的時候，頭髮經常是濕的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有“熱狗”，你喜歡吃熱狗嗎？博士給我和迷迭香一人買了兩個，我想下次試試淋點草莓味的糖漿一起吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是自己想來的。我纏了凱爾希醫生好久，一路上還給博士寫了好長的保證書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年我完成了全部課程與訓練，我能做很多任務，就和你還有塞雷婭一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血液源石結晶密度有小幅度上升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......上升速度與體細胞融合趨勢預測呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時在可控範圍內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他結果得等伊芙利特回本艦後再做一次全面檢查才知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要我回本艦......你們還是不相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，伊芙利特，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有塞雷婭在，不會有什麼但是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......四年多以前，就在這座城市，在同一塊招牌下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幾乎永遠失去了你。而在那一刻，她就在你身邊，與此時此刻沒什麼分別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我活下來了，而且活得好好的！塞雷婭保護了我，這次我可以和她一起保護你，保護所有人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，聽赫默的話。赫默是你的醫生，是你最該信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我一樣信任你！我還信任博士，信任迷迭香，這些信任沒有高低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞雷婭，那天我看見你了。你和穿著風衣的神秘人一起，出現在十三區的工廠。就在同一天，有東西從天上掉了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你也在現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一個與萊茵有關的秘密實驗，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你不會回答。因為......這是對我和伊芙利特的“保護”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就在十分鐘前，伊芙利特阻止的是一場針對副總統的刺殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非我有意隱瞞，赫默，我掌握的情報也很有限。此事背後牽涉勢力實在太多，我能做的也只有竭盡所能阻止事態惡化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“必須讓事情回歸正軌”——這句話我聽塞雷婭主任說過許多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萊茵的時候，你總是在控制事態，但那些可怕的實驗還是一茬接著一茬冒出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠有人在因為另一些人的野心受傷，而這些傷害並不能因為事後的正義審判而得到彌補，更不必提......本該有的審判從未發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍不住想......等這場火終於被你們撲滅的時候，有多少人會像當年的伊芙利特一樣，躺在廢墟中奄奄一息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只會比我想得更多更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還是習慣性地選擇幫他們“控制”。你希望損傷盡可能地小，最好小到讓人們察覺不到，而並非在源頭上扼殺所有的不道德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我無法否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭......這些年我一直想問你一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到真的站在萊茵的對面，是不是因為在骨子裡，你始終和他們......和總轄才是同類？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有狙擊手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，蹲下！伊芙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷......婭？"},{"type":"narration","text":"潔白的鈣質結晶在她眼前飄散。\n它們在剛剛那一瞬間保護了她和伊芙利特，卻隨著施術者的倒下而無聲地崩解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊手成功命中目標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼大功率的能量武器都足夠給裝甲車開個洞，卻還是沒能瞬間穿透這源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這該死的瓦伊凡和她的源石技藝*哥倫比亞粗口*比動力甲都要硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說......她還有存活的可能性？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“可能性”。我受夠了這個被那幾個搞研究的人掛在嘴邊的詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的是一個結果，明確的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那副總統那邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅蘭德不會給我們第二次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行動隊依舊在待命，是否讓他們立刻撤回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，給他們找點事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟那個最扎眼的瓦伊凡一樣，那些在萊茵現場搗亂的人，一個都別放過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是時候讓這些開了幾家公司就以為能撥弄風雲的傻瓜清醒清醒了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能在哥倫比亞的土地上，挑戰哥倫比亞軍隊的權威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布萊克，我把萊茵的人脈交給你，可不是為了讓你把萊茵拖下水的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就動用了你在萊茵裡的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惡人先告狀啊，斐爾迪南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道現在的情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人擾亂了情報輸送，引爆被提前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，記者已經引導了輿論，使得這件事情和傑克遜的訪問撇清了關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，刺殺失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣可以讓你滿意了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，斐爾迪南，把你藏著的武器收起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的以為你傷得了我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我不怪你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"布萊克拍了兩下斐爾迪南的臉。\n斐爾迪南本以為會從他的眼中看到殺氣，但是此時，他看到的竟然是笑意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在的情報來看，就算沒有你搗亂，萊茵大樓內部的刺殺也極為困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，到了這一步你的腦子裡依然是萊茵。忠於自己的欲望不是壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，斐爾迪南，我挺欣賞你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很適合當軍人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在我們失敗了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？這只是個開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好事啊，梅蘭德處處壓我們一頭，你知道我上面有多少人早就想拿梅蘭德開刀了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在事情徹底失控前，眼下的失敗只會讓我獲得更多的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果事情徹底失控——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，你不會想要知道我的下場的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我也無法保證你的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我依然會和約定的一樣，盡力幫你找到克麗斯騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能掌握她，事情就還有轉機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是對我們，還是......對萊茵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會去見一見雅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看是好運......還是命令，先追上我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A隊搜索那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"B隊向這邊搜索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目標是一個未佩帶武器的戴兜帽的人，以及一個能夠使用高殺傷力源石技藝的菲林女孩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我的終端亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著......伊芙利特和我約好的時間已經到了，但我感覺不到她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她應該已經和塞雷婭會合了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們的計劃成功了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"萊茵暫時是安全的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡......並不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗室太多了，每一間都有著一樣的白色的牆，就像迷宮一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特最討厭這樣的房間。她說起這些回憶的時候，呼吸會變得急促，手心的溫度也不像平時那麼滾燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去找她。我不想看見朋友受到傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些牆並沒有那麼堅硬，只要有你的命令，我很快就能帶你離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"先不要......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們還不能暴露位置。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你們決定留下這面牆。這些材料是從卡西米爾進口的，可算得上價格不菲啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不著這麼緊張，小姑娘，如你們所見，我是個兜裡只有鋼筆和錢包的生意人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您是......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"您好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"菲茨羅伊主任，沒想到會在這裡與您會面。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是啊，我下一個會議就在附近，想著剛好路過，就順便來和我們的客人打聲招呼罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......C區與D區已搜索完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有多間會議室，正準備逐一排查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走廊上有敵人，而且很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我命令吧，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"請等一下。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"還有客人在。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本是阻止了一場可怕陰謀的幕後英雄，卻很快淪為秘密抓捕的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥倫比亞，類似的事情屢見不鮮，寫成劇本在藍卡塢都賣不上好價錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是被阻撓的一方想要懲戒立威，還是發出委託的那一方想要讓這場未曾暴露的交易永遠石沉大海——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"似乎並沒有猜測的必要。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他們都有對我們“展開調查”的理由。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"包括您，菲茨羅伊主任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您特地在此時現身，不會只是想打個招呼吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，瞧我這一時興起，都快忘了有人正等我開會呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是耽誤您一點點時間，應該還不至於影響你們的計劃吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，要開始了，請站遠一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......菲茨羅伊主任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友通常叫我小賈斯汀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"小賈斯汀先生。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"讓軍方特工發現您和我們在一起，對您並沒有好處。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我告訴他們，您身邊這位年輕美麗的菲林小姐，與一項本該被塵封的軍方絕密實驗有關係呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是敵人的威脅嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這是朋友的提醒嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......選擇權在您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩提醒我一下，貴公司已經挖走了萊茵生命的多少位優秀員工？八位，還是十位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉女士可一直惦記著想要認識一下你們人事部門的負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然羅德島與萊茵生命合作得如此緊密——等下次見面的時候，說不定我已經準備好一份讓您無法拒絕的合約了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我很期待。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"羅德島感謝您的關注。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先不打擾您和這位菲林小姐了。對了，Dr.{@nickname}，等您回去之後，請務必替我問下繆爾賽思小姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她到底偏好什麼口味的餐廳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有最後一間會議室了。目標極有可能就在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"準備突入。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有沒有聽到什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防衛科成員？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水的聲音。啊，真美妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小賈斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......足以對抗命運的鮮活力量啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭......塞雷婭！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有反應......該不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......頭部受到的衝擊太大，雖然暫時沒有失去生命體征，但非常危險。她現在急需治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，幫我抬一下塞雷婭的手臂......唔，太沉了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想——再傷害塞雷婭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，我可以燒出一條路來，我們去找博士會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。盯上我們的人也一定盯上了羅德島。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，軍方的人已經進入萊茵，你們的朋友恐怕自身難保。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，孩子們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我可沒有辦法眼睜睜看著萊茵的另一位創始人倒在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g2_colombiaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副總統先生，聯合議會回電，關於那幾座軍事基地的裁撤法案做好了提前開聽證會的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，之前主動聯絡我們的那位大法官暗示，她願意配合我們推翻之前的判例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍方一定會為他們的冒失付出代價。樂觀估計，那個叫布萊克的上校會在半天之內撤出特里蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，一切都在等待您的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帕瓦爾，電話該來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，這裡是副總統先生臨時辦公室......是的，他就在我身邊......是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副總統先生，電話是從......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......給我吧，我知道找我的是誰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。這也是我的願望，我自然不會在這個節骨眼讓諸位失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副總統先生，法案的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擱置吧。在這半年之內，都不必把此事放進議程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......梅蘭德基金會的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帕瓦爾，你剛剛匯報說，先前那場鬧劇裡，死了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們擊斃了三十名軍方的行動人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們每年培養這些軍人要投入多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一名符合國防部標準的戰鬥人員的培訓成本是三百萬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，我們剛才損失了九千萬和三十個優秀的人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不必問這是誰的意思。這就是最符合哥倫比亞利益的決策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去幫我安排和布萊克的會面吧，我們和國防部該攜手合作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副總統秘書","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永遠記得，選舉結果出來的那一天，我志得意滿地以為，自己終於可以坐到那張夢寐以求的桌子前時——我受到了今生最大的衝擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那時候我差點以為這個國家的生活就是一個陰謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我逐漸意識到，並非如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個國家並沒有生活在一個陰謀之中，梅蘭德也不像我想像的那樣在操控著這個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是荒唐的事情發生得太有條理，以至於看起來像是我們真的在變好似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，我依舊是一個平凡的人類。時不時地，我的腦子裡會冒出一些可笑的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那場爆炸確實在我面前發生了，那麼......我會成為烈士被哥倫比亞銘記，還是被當作無能之輩，被迅速掃進歷史角落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......怎麼想？"},{"type":"narration","text":"副總統環顧著空蕩蕩的辦公室，就彷彿在等待無處不在的空氣回答自己的疑問。\n隨後，這個幾乎站在哥倫比亞權力頂點的人歎了口氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"軍方已經不會再給您找麻煩了吧，為何還是悶悶不樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍爾海雅小姐，想見你一面可不太容易。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您致歉。許久未見的上司也來到了特里蒙，我總是需要花些時間準備述職報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錫人恐怕忘了把你的報告傳給我一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我選擇自己來回答您的疑問。只要我知道的，我一定知無不言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你是梅蘭德基金會萊茵相關事務的第一負責人。你來告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰·萊特，這一切麻煩的罪魁禍首，此刻到底身在何處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在一個就連哥倫比亞最引以為豪的特種部隊都無法抵達的地方，一個從未被梅蘭德基金會記錄在案的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞沒有這樣的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它並不在哥倫比亞的地圖上，至少當前還不在。雖然這個位置極有可能與我們的城市和土地互相重疊，但它確實在我們的視線之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副總統先生，您無疑瞭解過“勘探計劃”，一系列歷時多年，由梅蘭德歷史協會......或者更確切地說，由錫人先生主導的考古計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些埋在大片荒原下的古代遺跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。恰好，在最近的一場針對萊茵相關人員的突擊行動中，我們發現了這份資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傑克遜","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勘探記錄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份記錄目前正握在萊茵生命的前高管，克麗斯騰·萊特的密友......以及一家在哥倫比亞有過犯罪記錄的境外企業手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而最為巧合的是，這家名為羅德島的企業，與我親愛的上司錫人先生關係匪淺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......淨水循環系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以直接稱它為，“排汙溝”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它曾經還有另一個名字，“咒術湍流焦點”。曾是提卡茲最原始的巫術武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這是它的名字最為完整的拼法。這東西居然就這麼裝在拓荒隊的移動板房上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，這套裝置最為核心的部分已經遺失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如今留下的只有最外層的管道，你們......對如何回收利用它發揮了合理的聯想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替哥倫比亞人收下你的誇讚，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個國家經歷過極為艱難的年歲。在物資匱乏的大拓荒時期，所有物品都只分為有用和無用兩類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你眼中，這可能是一段恢宏記憶的載體，可對生活在哥倫比亞的普通人來說，它就是一截好用的、多久都不會銹蝕的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，無論一件舊物多麼古老，無論它曾經歷過多麼偉大的時代，如果不能被這個時代的人們理解，那它就與廢品無異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"人們的認知不得不被自身所處的時間與空間約束。你我皆不例外......克麗斯騰·萊特也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......她不可能從類似的提卡茲遺產中汲取力量，她借助的外力只會更強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"還有三十二項最有可能的技術有待排除。這些技術大多並不在梅蘭德歷史協會的勘探記錄上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的路，想必你不再需要我的陪同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......如你所言。但這並不會影響我們與梅蘭德的合作關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是啊。這只是你一貫的行事準則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不希望這些技術落到克麗斯騰手裡......但你也同樣不想哥倫比亞過早地將這筆財富納入囊中。你依舊是那麼地......無私且中立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，我還有一件事想要拜託你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先說說看吧，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......還有那兩個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你說的那樣，有些路只有我一個人能走。在那些我不方便的時刻，麻煩你照看一下他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，判斷失誤。你也並非毫無變化啊，女士。你比過去要有人情味得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有任何人或者事是一成不變的，死魂靈......錫人先生。我們能做的只有接受這些改變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，博士，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我應該是把水控制在不進入呼吸道的程度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，太久沒用這一招，控制水準下降了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士應該是因為途中的顛簸而昏迷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——抱歉抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都怪那個小賈斯汀，突然拋了一大堆文件給我，說每個主任都要填，不然拿不到下個年度的經費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好險，差點就沒趕上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"咳咳......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"沒趕上什麼？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你醒了，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早安......不對，是晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們已經不在萊茵了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我最後的記憶是通風管道——","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，在我得知你們有危險後，就一直在操控著水尋找你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們即將被發現的時候，我終於找到了你們，於是，就用水把你們包裹起來，運到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事急從權，有些顛簸就體諒一下啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我欠你一次。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救過我一次，我救了你一次......唔，不知道下一次是誰救誰呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你該不會在想要怎麼報答我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......下次陪我去購物怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"大恩大德，無以回報。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有那麼了不起啦，嘻嘻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過呢，你要是真的覺得無以回報，就在這份雇傭合約上簽個字吧！我不介意多一個像你這麼聰明的助手哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......雖然你剛醒來，但是，我必須告訴你一個壞消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾乎就在你和迷迭香被襲擊的同時，塞雷婭也被襲擊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"塞雷婭還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體情況我也不怎麼瞭解，但那可是比鑽石還硬的塞雷婭哎！不至於有生命危險吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關鍵是接下來該怎麼辦。你也感受到了，軍方一旦決定警告你們，可不會輕易放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你的處境，不，應該說，羅德島的處境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體情況我也不怎麼瞭解，但那可是比鑽石還硬的塞雷婭哎！不至於有生命危險吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關鍵是接下來該怎麼辦。你也感受到了，軍方一旦決定警告你們，可不會輕易放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你的處境，不，應該說，羅德島的處境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"伊芙利特呢？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙芙應該還好，只是塞雷婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體情況我也不怎麼瞭解，但那可是比鑽石還硬的塞雷婭哎！不至於有生命危險吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關鍵是接下來該怎麼辦。你也感受到了，軍方一旦決定警告你們，可不會輕易放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你的處境，不，應該說，羅德島的處境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走廊上......有人正朝我們走過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這一路上可是很謹慎的哦，軍方的人不可能這麼輕鬆地跟上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會是梅蘭德的人？比如那位鐵罐頭先生和他的下屬們......特工一般都是這樣神出鬼沒的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香，是錫人嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼都感覺不出來......他給我的感覺，嗯......很普通......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"繆爾賽思，能不能幫忙留意下周圍情況？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是想讓我多分幾雙“眼睛”去外面嗎？沒問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......終於......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我是不是來晚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本想在你剛剛進入特里蒙的時候，就來見你的。可惜......這份工作比我想像的還要費些功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我記得你的臉，在資料上......你是洛肯·威廉姆斯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛......肯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是收到我的信了，納西莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......納西莎是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫迷迭香。這是我唯一的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......沒關係，重要的是你來到了這裡。不瞞你說，我從寄出信件開始，就一直有些忐忑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你願意來見我......我真的很高興。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
